      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Lower the Tusks</h1><p><em>Its shoulders bunch behind the lowered tusks.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-wild-boar-lower-the-tusks</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>Gain Stability 1 until its next turn. Use the highest Stability; also gain 1 Boon on its next Tusks attack this turn (1 extra Bane on that target’s defense).</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
      },
